      "message": "This can be probably simplified.\n```A2dpSSM existingSM \u003d mDeviceStateMap.get(device);\nif( existingSM \u003d\u003d null ) {\n   A2SSM newSM \u003d new A2SSM(device, this, mNativeInterface);\n   mDeviceStateMap.put(device, newSSM)\n} else {\n   return existingSSM;\n}```",
