      "message": "Should it invoke doQuit() before adding a new state machine here? i.e.\n```\nStep 1: Get existing state machine for device.\nStep 2: If it\u0027s not null, invoke doQuite.\nStep 3: Add the new state machine as per the current logic \n```\nThis is to ensure to future proof `addDeviceToMapAndConnect`. In case any other caller invokes this method, the existing machine is quite before creating a new one.",
